  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant is a merger of core funding and project specific funding for the Equity and Ambition Group which will go towards TWN&apos;s ongoing work on climate advocacy and policy making in the UNFCCC spaces. A part of this grant goes towards hiring a coordinator for the Equity and Ambition Group, which is a coalition of 30 global south organisations working on climate issues.</narrative>
